          {
            "id": 2896767,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Now if you can take a look at your plans, you'll see Branley Castle has four towers joined together by a high wall with the river on two sides. Don't miss seeing the Great Hall. That's near the river in the main tower, the biggest one which was extended and redesigned in the eighteenth century. If you want to get a good view of the whole castle, you can walk around the walls. The starting point's quite near the main entrance.",
